{
  "id": "691",
  "title": "It Stopped Raining",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-05-18",
  "synopsis": "Little He wants to know if he should bring an umbrella or not.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1048/82d2b8e352c47d182a482efac97b32455f23ea9d.mp3?1557482011",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "雨停了\n\n小何：妈，是我。你那边天气怎么样？\n妈妈：啊，天气啊。今天早上雨下得很大，但是现在雨停了。不知道等会儿还会不会下。\n小何：这样啊，那我还是带伞去吧。\n妈妈：嗯，是啊。路上小心啊！",
    "traditional": "雨停了\n\n小何：媽，是我。你那邊天氣怎麼樣？\n媽媽：啊，天氣啊。今天早上雨下得很大，但是現在雨停了。不知道等會兒還會不會下。\n小何：這樣啊，那我還是帶傘去吧。\n媽媽：嗯，是啊。路上小心啊！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It Stopped Raining"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：妈，是我。你那边天气怎么样？",
      "traditional": "小何：媽，是我。你那邊天氣怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé mā shì wǒ nǐ nà bian tiān qì zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Mom, it’s me. How is the weather over there?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈：啊，天气啊。今天早上雨下得很大，但是现在雨停了。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：啊，天氣啊。今天早上雨下得很大，但是現在雨停了。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma a tiān qì a jīn tiān zǎo shang yǔ xià de hěn dà dàn shì xiàn zài yǔ tíng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "不知道等会儿还会不会下。",
      "traditional": "不知道等會兒還會不會下。",
      "pinyin": "bù zhī dào děng huì'r hái huì bú huì xià",
      "english": "Mom: Ah, the weather. This morning it rained a lot, but it stopped raining now."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I don’t know if it will start to rain again soon or not."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小何：这样啊，那我还是带伞去吧。",
      "traditional": "小何：這樣啊，那我還是帶傘去吧。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhè yàng a nà wǒ hái shi dài sǎn qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: I see. Then I better bring an umbrella with me."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "妈妈：嗯，是啊。路上小心啊！",
      "traditional": "媽媽：嗯，是啊。路上小心啊！",
      "pinyin": "mā ma èn shì a lù shang xiǎo xīn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Yes, that would be best. Be careful on the road!"
    }
  ],
